# Landing Page Animations (דף נחיתה)

Purposeful motion that guides the eye — never jittery or distracting.

## Stack (this project)

- **CSS**: `src/styles/animations.css` — reveal variants + reduced-motion
- **Hook**: `useScrollReveal`, `useStaggerReveal`, `useMountReveal` in `src/hooks/useScrollReveal.js`
- **Component**: `<Reveal variant="up" delay={0.1} />` for one-off blocks

## When to use what

| Zone | Hook / pattern | Notes |
|------|----------------|-------|
| Hero (above fold) | `useMountReveal(120)` | Plays on load, not scroll |
| Section headings | `<Reveal variant="up">` | Single block |
| Grids / lists | `useStaggerReveal({ staggerDelay: 0.08 })` | 60–100ms between items |
| Split columns (About, Contact) | `revealStart` + `revealEnd` | RTL-aware in CSS |
| Cards / gallery | `variant="scale"` | Subtle scale 0.94 → 1 |
| CTA bands | `<Reveal variant="scale">` | One focal entrance |

## Defaults (do not weaken without reason)

```js
// useScrollReveal defaults
{ threshold: 0.08, rootMargin: '0px', once: true }
```

- **`once: true`** — revealed elements stay visible (no fade-out on scroll)
- **Only animate `transform` and `opacity`** — never width/height/margin
- **Reveal duration**: ~550ms, easing `cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`
- **Hover / micro**: 200–300ms (`var(--transition-base)`)
- **Stagger**: 0.06–0.1s per child

## Micro-interactions

- Buttons: `translateY(-2px)` + soft shadow on hover (see `BookButton`)
- Cards/chips: border-color + slight lift on hover
- Hero video: slow Ken Burns (`scale` only, 18–22s, `prefers-reduced-motion` off)

## Accessibility

Always respect `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` — skip motion, show content immediately.

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ `once: false` on landing sections (causes disappearing content)
- ❌ Negative `rootMargin` on reveals (premature hide/show flicker)
- ❌ Animating layout properties or heavy box-shadow loops
- ❌ More than one “hero” animation fighting for attention
